econdary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">232 sqm</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"beds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Max. Beds</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rent\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rent</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500,000 gp per month<br/>(2,155 gp per sqm)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Location</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Carlin</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"street\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Street</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Sea Lane</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Features</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"openwindows\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Windows</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">14</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"floors\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Floors</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rooms\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rooms</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">16</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2000</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Buildings <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-house-furnishings\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Furnishings\">Furnishings</span></h3>\n<p>4 Blackboard, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Casks\">Casks</a>, Counter, 2 Dustbins, 18 <a href=\"#/wiki/Wall%20Lamp\">Wall Lamps</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-house-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145837&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\"/>\n<div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n</div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\">\n<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32341,31847,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32341, 31847, 7)</a></div>\n<p>Southern most <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>, on Sea Lane.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-house-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"tw-cmd\" data-command=\"get-house-url\" data-houseid=\"20901\" data-housetype=\"guildhalls\"></div></dd></dl>\n<p>There are 2 and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bed\">beds</a> in two of four rooms in basement, a selling shop bar on ground floor, and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bed\">bed</a> in one of the three rooms on the second floor, 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bed\">bed</a> in one of three rooms on second floor, 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bed\">bed</a> in single room on fourth floor. 13 total doors. Rooms:<br/>\nBasement: 4 rooms (3 rooms with 2 beds each), 1st floor (one shop), 2nd floor (1 bed, 1 balcony), 3rd floor (1 room, 1 bed), 4th floor (1 bed)\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-house-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before April 15, 2019, this house's rent was 10080 gold per month.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Sea_Lane_Buildings\">Related Sea Lane Buildings</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Lonely Sea Side Hostel</li><li>White Wave Cellar</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":[]}